[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 75 Uncomfortable",
    "start": 1.57,
    "end": 5.632,
    "zh": "第75课 不舒服的",
    "zh_hant": "第75課 不舒服的"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "shoes",
    "start": 5.282,
    "end": 6.253,
    "zh": "鞋子",
    "zh_hant": "鞋子"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
    "start": 7.173,
    "end": 11.075,
    "zh": "听录音，然后回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音，然後回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "What's wrong with the fashionable shoes?",
    "start": 13.236,
    "end": 16.638,
    "zh": "这双时髦的鞋子有什么问题？",
    "zh_hant": "這雙時髦的鞋子有什麼問題？"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "Do you have any shoes like these?",
    "start": 19.019,
    "end": 21.7,
    "zh": "你有像这样的鞋子吗？",
    "zh_hant": "你有像這樣的鞋子嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "What size?",
    "start": 21.86,
    "end": 24.001,
    "zh": "什么尺码？",
    "zh_hant": "什麼尺碼？"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "five.",
    "start": 23.651,
    "end": 24.462,
    "zh": "五码。",
    "zh_hant": "五碼。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "What colour?",
    "start": 24.622,
    "end": 25.822,
    "zh": "什么颜色？",
    "zh_hant": "什麼顏色？"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "Black.",
    "start": 25.842,
    "end": 26.723,
    "zh": "黑色。",
    "zh_hant": "黑色。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "I'm sorry.",
    "start": 26.943,
    "end": 28.163,
    "zh": "对不起。",
    "zh_hant": "對不起。"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "We don't have any.",
    "start": 28.204,
    "end": 29.684,
    "zh": "我们没有。",
    "zh_hant": "我們沒有。"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "But my sister bought this pair last month.",
    "start": 30.225,
    "end": 33.506,
    "zh": "但我姐姐上个月买了一双。",
    "zh_hant": "但我姐姐上個月買了一雙。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "Did she buy them here?",
    "start": 33.686,
    "end": 35.667,
    "zh": "她是在这儿买的吗？",
    "zh_hant": "她是在這兒買的嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "No, she bought them in the U. S.",
    "start": 36.107,
    "end": 38.969,
    "zh": "不，她是在美国买的。",
    "zh_hant": "不，她是在美國買的。"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "We had some shoes like those a month ago,",
    "start": 39.909,
    "end": 43.111,
    "zh": "一个月前我们有些像那样的鞋子，",
    "zh_hant": "一個月前我們有些像那樣的鞋子，"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "but we don't have any now.",
    "start": 43.672,
    "end": 45.873,
    "zh": "但现在没有了。",
    "zh_hant": "但現在沒有了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "Can you get a pair for me, please?",
    "start": 46.694,
    "end": 49.435,
    "zh": "你能帮我弄一双吗？",
    "zh_hant": "你能幫我弄一雙嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "I'm afraid that I can't.",
    "start": 49.776,
    "end": 52.097,
    "zh": "恐怕不行。",
    "zh_hant": "恐怕不行。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "They were in fashion last year",
    "start": 52.337,
    "end": 54.938,
    "zh": "它们去年很流行，",
    "zh_hant": "它們去年很流行，"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "and the year before last.",
    "start": 55.079,
    "end": 57.34,
    "zh": "前年也流行。",
    "zh_hant": "前年也流行。"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "But they're not in fashion this year.",
    "start": 57.48,
    "end": 60.442,
    "zh": "但今年不流行了。",
    "zh_hant": "但今年不流行了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "These shoes are in fashion now.",
    "start": 61.883,
    "end": 64.484,
    "zh": "这些鞋子现在很流行。",
    "zh_hant": "這些鞋子現在很流行。"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "They look very uncomfortable.",
    "start": 65.185,
    "end": 67.726,
    "zh": "它们看起来很不舒服。",
    "zh_hant": "它們看起來很不舒服。"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "They are very uncomfortable.",
    "start": 68.406,
    "end": 71.128,
    "zh": "它们确实很不舒服。",
    "zh_hant": "它們確實很不舒服。"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "But women always wear uncomfortable shoes!",
    "start": 71.188,
    "end": 74.83,
    "zh": "但女人总是穿不舒服的鞋子！",
    "zh_hant": "但女人總是穿不舒服的鞋子！"
  }
]
